      "role": "user",
      "content": "That makes sense from the perspective of the administration. To help with the scene, could you elaborate on what you mean by the \"chaos\" and \"internal divisions\"? From your position as an official, how would you describe the local people themselves? Do you feel they are actually capable of managing such a vast territory without British guidance, or is there something about their nature that makes them unfit for self-rule?",
