      "content": "Since you're sticking to the character, I want to push the scene even further. In the script, my character is a skeptic of the Raj. I'll ask: \"That sounds very paternalistic. Some critics say we aren't just 'disciplining' them, but that we actually view them as fundamentally inferior—almost like children who don't know what's good for them. In your private letters or amongst your peers in the service, is there a sense that there's a natural hierarchy at play? That certain races are just biologically or culturally destined to be led by others?\"",
